  ==============================================
   KickOS 0.5.1  -  microkernel RTOS
  ==============================================
   board   qemu
   arch    armv7m
   cpu     cortex-m4
   mpu     enforce
   sched   tickless

mutexbench: the mutex and the C library's locks, as an application pays
mutexbench: load: 5 threads, 1 load pairs, a crowd of 2
  mutex: lock+unlock 200 ns/pair  (200000 pairs / 40 ms)
  libc-lock: malloc+free 950 ns/pair  (200000 pairs / 190 ms)
  libc-lock: getenv 500 ns/call  (200000 calls / 100 ms)
  syscall: thread_self 50 ns/call  (200000 calls / 10 ms)
  syscall: cpu_clock_hz 1950 ns/call  (200000 calls / 390 ms)
  syscall: clock_now 2400 ns/call  (200000 calls / 480 ms)
  syscall: core_current 50 ns/call  (200000 calls / 10 ms)
  sem: post+wait 100 ns/pair  (200000 pairs / 20 ms)
  mutex-handoff-round: 120000 ns/round  (20000 rounds / 2400 ms) [one core]
  mutex-handoff: SKIP (the clock steps 10000 us)
  mutex-handoff-loaded-round: 84500 ns/round  (20000 rounds / 1690 ms) [one core; 1 pairs parked]
  mutex-handoff-loaded: SKIP (the clock steps 10000 us)
  sem-handoff-round: 49000 ns/round  (20000 rounds / 980 ms) [one core]
  sem-handoff: SKIP (the clock steps 10000 us)
  sem-wake-crowd: SKIP (the clock steps 10000 us)
  mutex-handoff-window: SKIP (no address spaces)
mutexbench: done
